        "original_id": "26dd59ae-c85d-5a16-a736-c05e48d4d9ba",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Miles Kane, Carl Barât, Pete Doherty\n- Bands: The Libertines, The Last Shadow Puppets\n- Songs and Albums: \"Don't Forget Who You Are\"\n- Places: London, United Kingdom\n\nFacts:\n- The Libertines are an English rock band formed in London in 1997.\n- Carl Barât and Pete Doherty formed The Libertines and served as the band's frontmen, with both on vocals and guitar.\n- Miles Peter Kane was born on 17 March 1986 and is an English musician.\n- Miles Kane is known as a solo artist and as the co-frontman of The Last Shadow Puppets.\n- \"Don't Forget Who You Are\" is a song by Miles Kane from his second studio album of the same name.\n- \"Don't Forget Who You Are\" was released as a digital download in the United Kingdom on 3 June 2013.",
